{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55514","headline":"过梁震居留题 · 罗隐","name":"过梁震居留题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道院迎仙客，书堂隐相儒。\n庭栽栖凤竹，池养化龙鱼。\n（见《尧山堂外纪》卷三九、《全浙诗话》卷八。\n）（按：隐卒开平间，震至後康时始在荆南握重权。\n诗疑出僞托。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55514.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55514","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}